tools.description:
Open the Browser pane: pass `url` to open a browser tab at a URL (no dev server needed — use this for external sites, staging, docs, or your deployed app), OR pass `name` to start a dev server from .claude/launch.json.

Start a dev server by name from .claude/launch.json. If .claude/launch.json doesn't exist, create it first with this format:
{
  "version": "0.0.1",
  "configurations": [
    {
      "name": "<unique-name>",
      "runtimeExecutable": "<command>",
      "runtimeArgs": ["<args>"],
      "port": <port>
    }
  ]
}
Set "runtimeExecutable" to the command (e.g. "npm"), "runtimeArgs" to the arguments (e.g. ["run", "dev"]), and "port" to the server port. An optional "url" (http/https) opens the preview there instead of http://localhost:<port>. A localhost "url" must be just the server's origin — no path or query, matching the entry's port — for example "https://localhost:8443" or "http://app.localhost:3000"; to show a specific page, navigate after the preview opens. Non-localhost URLs may carry paths and are subject to the user's permission and the organization's browsing policy. A configuration with "url" and no command attaches to an already-running server. Only include servers you actually need to preview. Reuses the server if already running. ALWAYS use this instead of Bash for running servers. If the deliverable is already published as an Artifact, update the Artifact instead of starting a server to show it.

input.content:
/*
 * Colors follow Figma on purpose: no gradients are added under the text,
 * so contrast over the photos is a documented WCAG exception.
 * Controls sit in a bottom row until the viewport leaves room for the side
 * arrows from Figma without covering the text (117.5rem / 1880px).
 */
.hero {
  position: relative;
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
  min-height: max(min(100svh, var(--hero-max-height)), 37.5rem);
  padding-block: 7.5rem 9rem;
  overflow: clip;
  color: var(--color-white);
}

.hero__slides {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
}

.hero__slide {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  opacity: 0;
  transition: opacity var(--duration-fade) var(--ease-standard);
}

.hero__slide--active {
  opacity: 1;
}

.hero__image {
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  object-fit: cover;
}

.hero__slide--zoom .hero__image {
  animation: hero-zoom var(--duration-slide) var(--ease-out);
}

@keyframes hero-zoom {
  from {
    transform: scale(1.05);
  }
}

.hero__content {
  position: relative;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: flex-start;
  gap: var(--space-32);
}

.hero__heading {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--space-16);
}

.hero__eyebrow {
  font-size: var(--font-size-base);
  line-height: var(--line-height-base);
}

.hero__title {
  font-size: var(--font-size-display);
  line-height: var(--line-height-none);
}

/* Controls */
.hero__arrow {
  position: absolute;
  inset-block-end: var(--space-16);
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  width: var(--size-control);
  height: var(--size-control);
  background: var(--color-scrim-soft);
  border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
}

.hero__arrow--prev {
  inset-inline-start: max(var(--space-16), calc(50% - 10.125rem));
}

.hero__arrow--next {
  inset-inline-end: max(var(--space-16), calc(50% - 10.125rem));
}

.hero__progress {
  position: absolute;
  inset-block-end: calc(var(--space-16) + var(--size-control) / 2 - 1px);
  inset-inline-start: 50%;
  display: flex;
  gap: var(--space-4);
  transform: translateX(-50%);
}

.hero__bar {
  position: relative;
  width: var(--space-48);
  height: 2px;
  overflow: hidden;
  background: var(--color-track);
}

.hero__bar::after {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  background: var(--color-accent);
  transform: scaleX(0);
  transform-origin: left;
}

.hero__bar--active::after {
  transform: scaleX(1);
}

.js .hero__bar--active::after {
  animation: hero-progress var(--duration-slider-interval) linear both;
}

.hero--paused .hero__bar--active::after {
  animation-play-state: paused;
}

@keyframes hero-progress {
  from {
    transform: scaleX(0);
  }

  to {
    transform: scaleX(1);
  }
}

.hero__pause {
  position: absolute;
  inset-block-start: 50%;
  inset-inline-start: calc(100% + var(--space-4));
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  width: var(--space-32);
  height: var(--space-32);
  background: var(--color-scrim-soft);
  border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
  transform: translateY(-50%);
}

.hero__pause-icon--play,
.hero__pause[aria-pressed="true"] .hero__pause-icon--pause {
  display: none;
}

.hero__pause[aria-pressed="true"] .hero__pause-icon--play {
  display: block;
}

html:not(.js) .hero__arrow,
html:not(.js) .hero__pause {
  display: none;
}

/* Rating badge */
.hero__badge {
  position: absolute;
  inset-block-end: 5.5rem;
  inset-inline-end: var(--space-16);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: var(--space-12);
  padding: var(--space-12) var(--space-24);
  background: var(--color-scrim);
  border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
}

.hero__rating {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: var(--space-2);
  font-size: var(--font-size-title);
  font-weight: var(--font-weight-bold);
  line-height: var(--line-height-tight);
}

.hero__badge-label {
  font-size: var(--font-size-small);
  line-height: var(--line-height-tight);
  white-space: nowrap;
}

@media (min-width: 48rem) {
  .hero {
    align-items: center;
    padding-block: var(--space-96);
  }

  .hero__bar {
    width: var(--space-64);
  }

  .hero__pause {
    inset-inline-start: calc(100% + var(--space-8));
  }
}

@media (min-width: 60rem) {
  .hero__badge {
    inset-block-end: var(--space-16);
  }
}

/* Side arrows and bottom offsets from Figma */
@media (min-width: 117.5rem) {
  .hero__arrow {
    inset-block-end: auto;
    inset-block-start: 50%;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
  }

  .hero__arrow--prev {
    inset-inline-start: var(--space-72);
  }

  .hero__arrow--next {
    inset-inline-end: var(--space-72);
  }

  .hero__progress {
    inset-block-end: var(--space-32);
  }

  .hero__badge {
    inset-block-end: var(--space-32);
    inset-inline-end: var(--space-72);
  }
}

